### Admin Token 생성
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/admin/tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identification": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "adminpassword"
}

### 모든 회원 조회 (기본)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 모든 회원 조회 (페이지네이션)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/admin/users?page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 회원 검색 (통합 검색)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/admin/users?search=완벽한
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 회원 검색 (닉네임만)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/admin/users?nickname=완벽한
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 회원 검색 (아이디/이메일만)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/admin/users?identification=example
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 회원 검색 (가입일 - 올바른 형식)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/admin/users?createdAt=2025-01-15
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 회원 검색 (가입일 - 잘못된 형식 - 400 에러 예상)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/admin/users?createdAt=2025/01/15
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 회원 검색 (닉네임 - 특수문자 포함 - 400 에러 예상)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/admin/users?nickname=user@123
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 회원 검색 (아이디 - 한글 포함 - 400 에러 예상)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/admin/users?identification=사용자@email.com
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 상태별 필터링 (활성 사용자)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/admin/users?state=active
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 역할별 필터링 (일반 사용자)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/admin/users?role=USER
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 복합 필터링 (닉네임 + 상태 + 역할)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/admin/users?nickname=완벽한&state=active&role=USER&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 복합 필터링 (아이디 + 가입일 + 상태)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/admin/users?identification=example&createdAt=2025-01-15&state=active&page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ===== Restaurant Review Filtering =====

### 식당 리뷰 필터링 (등록일)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/admin/restaurant/review?createdAt=2025-01-15
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 식당 리뷰 필터링 (등록일 + 페이지네이션)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/admin/restaurant/review?createdAt=2025-01-15&page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 식당 리뷰 필터링 (잘못된 날짜 형식 - 400 에러 예상)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/admin/restaurant/review?createdAt=2025/01/15
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 식당 리뷰 필터링 (좌표 기반 - PostGIS 사용)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/admin/restaurant/review?latitude=37.5665&longitude=126.9780&radius=3000
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 식당 리뷰 필터링 (좌표 기반 - 기본 반경 5km)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/admin/restaurant/review?latitude=37.5665&longitude=126.9780
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 식당 리뷰 필터링 (복합 필터링)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/admin/restaurant/review?createdAt=2025-01-15&latitude=37.5665&longitude=126.9780&radius=3000&page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}} 